{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"screen\":\"舞步变得灵活流动，从前半段的焦躁转入后半段的柔和\",\"source\":\"一种听法把前半段（66–79小节）听成焦躁、急切，后半段（80–91小节）则忽然柔和、亲切，带一点近乎田园的轻盈。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿明确将这种情绪变化限定为一种听法，屏幕稿却写成确定的情绪走向，丢掉了可选解释的限定。\"},{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"screen\":\"先前带波兰舞曲气息的声音重现，却已不再完整鲜明\",\"source\":\"也可以听成：182–197小节，也可以听成先前那些更有宣告意味、带着波兰舞曲气息的声音再次出现；只是它已不再像最初那样，以完整而鲜明的姿态建立秩序。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将波兰舞曲声音的回返明确作为一种可选听法，屏幕稿却直接断定它重现，确定性提高。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"先前的摇篮曲在F小调上破碎重现，听来凄厉哀婉\",\"source\":\"另一种更凄厉哀婉的听法，是听见先前那段摇篮曲破碎地重现，只是这次变成了F小调。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿明确说这是另一种听法，屏幕稿却把摇篮曲重现写成确定事实，容易让观众把可选的音乐联想当成确定的主题回归。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fa838861-67ec-467a-bc72-1fb1c96bc002", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T050824498254Z", "elapsed_seconds": 488.219, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T05:16:32.724941+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6e20d42329d48aeee9753985a3abced1f1dfac5f7cfab4c3912a24630afb007c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_co